OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation launched into new dog
OL,4,Aban along coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public consultation has been launched
OL,7,Fseeking to ban dogs and other pets
OL,8,Fbetween two areas of coastline in Kent.
OL,10,FThe proposed Public Space Protection
OL,11,FOrder (PSPO) would last for three years
OL,12,Fand would replace an existing policy
OL,13,Fagreed by Thanet District Council in
OL,14,F2023.
OL,16,FThe proposal covers the northern sea
OL,17,Fwall between Cold Harbour and Plum
OL,18,FPudding, located between Minnis Bay and
OL,19,FReculver in Birchington.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
