OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation launched into new dog
OL,4,Aban along coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said that the
OL,7,Frecommendation was based on evidence
OL,8,Ffrom Bird Wise East Kent, which
OL,9,Freported significant disturbance to
OL,10,Fbirds in the area and ongoing problems
OL,11,Fwith dog control and dog fouling.
